          "merged_at": "2026-09-18T21:09:45Z"
        },
        "body": "Full-audit hardening follow-up to #255.\n\n- blocks DELETE while Runtime still reports WORKING, closing the STOP -> DELETE race with a gracefully finishing Playwright job;\n- distinguishes truly unresolved real-action guards from stale guards whose listing currentStep already proves the guarded step completed;\n- before deletion, confirms any unconfirmed marketplace FIRST_OFFER claim when the owner listing already has current_step >= 1, preserving durable cross-bot ownership without permanently blocking deletion;\n- keeps genuinely pre-submit/unresolved guards and claims fail-closed.\n\nNo normal scheduler/negotiation behavior changes.",
